# Process Charter: IT Change Management

## 1. Process Objective
Meningkatkan stabilitas operasional IT dan meminimalkan risiko gangguan bisnis (*unplanned downtime*) melalui mekanisme evaluasi, persetujuan, dan kontrol eksekusi perubahan infrastruktur dan aplikasi secara terstruktur.

## 2. Process Scope
* **In Scope:** Seluruh perubahan pada Hardware, Network, Server, Software, Database, dan Cloud Infrastructure di seluruh lingkungan produksi (*Production*).
* **Out of Scope:** Permintaan layanan rutin user (dikelola via *Service Request Management*).

## 3. RACI Matrix
| Role / Function | Request Creation | CAB Review & Risk Assessment | Execution | Post-Implementation Review (PIR) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Change Requester** | **R** (Responsible) | **I** (Informed) | **I** (Informed) | **C** (Consulted) |
| **Change Advisory Board (CAB)** | **I** (Informed) | **A** (Accountable) | **I** (Informed) | **A** (Accountable) |
| **Infrastructure / Dev Team** | **C** (Consulted) | **C** (Consulted) | **R** (Responsible) | **R** (Responsible) |

## 4. Key Metrics (KPIs)
* **Success Rate of Changes:** ≥ 98%
* **Emergency Change Ratio:** < 5% dari total Change Request
* **Unplanned Outages caused by Changes:** 0 Incidents (Target)
